  lines:
  - english: "Aid the realm and give tribute!\t"
    swedish: Hjalp riket, skank tribut!
  - english: Make your contribution
    swedish: Bidra
  - english: Offer what you can
    swedish: Ge det du kan
  - english: The thane farours your tribute
    swedish: Hovdingen hedrar din tribut
  - english: Give tribute to the realm
    swedish: Ge tribut till riket
  - english: You have anything useful?
    swedish: Har du nagot anvandbart?
  - english: Contribute to the common good
    swedish: Bidra till det goda almanna
  - english: Support the cause of the realm
    swedish: Stotta rikets intresse
  - english: Let your tribute speak for you
    swedish: Lat din gava tala
  - english: Bring forth your tribute
    swedish: Led fram din tribut
  - english: Intresting...
    swedish: Intressant...
  - english: Give tribute to the realm
    swedish: Ge tribut till riket
